    {
      "start": 0.46,
      "end": 5.48,
      "text": "Step 1. Name the section. Use the document's own headings and keywords."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.46,
      "end": 11.06,
      "text": "Step 2. Ask one thing. Give retrieval one clear target at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.9,
      "end": 17.58,
      "text": "Step 3. Share what matters. Paste the exact passage or upload only the relevant section."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.5,
      "end": 25.26,
      "text": "Finally, step 4. Ask for the quote. Ask AI to quote the exact passage, then compare it with the original."
    }
